			<Text>ショウロ『あたしに
なにか　ききたいこと　ありますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T07:21:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T07:21:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
