				Time="2011-12-24T10:19:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:27:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後
・ポケモン入手前
